  "about": "Two winters after the storm that took her father's boat, Maren Holt comes back to the harbour town she swore she had left for good. The lighthouse is dark, the keeper's logbook is missing, and every letter her father never sent seems to be turning up at once. The second Harbour Quartet novel follows Maren through one long season of fog, salt and old debts, as the town decides whether she is still one of its own.",
